[[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the front bolts fixing the seat to the bodyshell.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003436.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>Lower the rear seat backrest.</p><p>1. Use the lever to remove the seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003437.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Position the rear seat, securing the rear devices (1a) to the supports (1b) on the floor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003438.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>Tighten the front bolts fixing it to the floor to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT ASSEMBLY.</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Reposition the rear seat backrest.</p>"]]